Assuming you're running VMS, this should do the trick:
From the $ prompt, issue these commands:
$ write sys$output f$getsyi("hw_name")
$ write sys$output f$getsyi("hw_model")

This is not available in very old versions of VMS, but should be available
on any version supporting the 3100.

