Here are two more:

Questions 19 and 20 ask `Which vendor can best attract (Tru64 UNIX|VMS)
users who plan to switch platforms?'.  For each question, there is a
list of five vendors, and you must select exactly one.  Which means nobody
can give the obviously reasonable answer that different users are likely
to pick different vendors according to need.  In fact, the last site where
I used Tru64 would likely migrate in several directions: to SGI or possibly
