>
> Not on all CPU architectures.  Not on all hardware implementations
> of those architectures.   A program at the application level should
> never have to distinguish between memory and cache.  A monitor
> should be able to distinguish between memory and cache.  The
> hardware should be able to make it easy for the monitor to
> do that distinguishing.
