That's true, they just shot the horse before it starved to death, but
I just don't remember Alpha EVER being priced to sell. At any level
I've come across examples, whether it be :

- a complete DEC VAX shop switching to Sun because of clueless,
incredible prices ("on your budget, we're specifying a small
workstation as your departmental development server, our specint
