The RA73 was designed to work with a UDA50.  That is the controller that
all UNIBUS VAX and PDP-11 systems used for any directly attached RA
(MSCP) disk that use an SDI interface.  I use RA72 disks on my
PDP-11/70.  There is only one bootstrap for all MSCP (RA) disks on a
PDP-11.  The same one works for any RA60,8x,9x, or 7x.  I assume that
the same is true for the VAX-11 systems.

