How can he switch from ARC to SRM,  if he doesn't get any
output on the screen?????

Switch your Alpha Box off,
disconnect keyboard and mouse,
connect VTxxx to serial port #1 (also known as COM1),
setup  your VTxxx connection to as described in the answer bevor,
switch your Alpha Box on,
wait appr. 60sec. for POST completion

Sometimes it helps to hit RETURN a view times after POST (PowerOnSelfTest),
which takes approximately 60 seconds (depends on HW-Config).

greetings, Mike


